---
// About.astro
---

<section id="about" class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-stone-100/60 border-y border-stone-200/80 scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Title -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-3 mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-200/60 text-amber-900 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span>✨</span>
        <span>Kenapa Memilih Kami</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-serif-brand text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight">
        Kelezatan Otentik yang Diproses dengan Hati
      </h2>
      <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Kami memadukan tradisi biji kopi terbaik Nusantara dengan inovasi kelembutan roti modern demi menghadirkan senyuman di setiap tegukan dan gigitan.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento Grid Container -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Bento Card 1 (Large - 7 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-stone-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            ☕
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 uppercase tracking-wider">100% Kopi Arabika Nusantara</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif-brand text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-1">
            Biji Kopi Pilihan dari Dataran Tinggi Indonesia
          </h3>
          <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-2.5 leading-relaxed">
            Setiap cangkir diseduh dari biji kopi arabika pilihan pegunungan Aceh Gayo dan Kintamani Bali. Dipanggang dengan profil *medium-dark roast* untuk menghasilkan aroma cokelat karamel yang tebal dan tingkat keasaman seimbang yang nyaman di lambung.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center gap-4 text-xs font-semibold text-stone-700">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-emerald-500">✓</span> Freshly Ground Espresso</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-emerald-500">✓</span> Susu Segar Pasteurisasi</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Card 2 (5 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-900 to-amber-950 text-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            🍯
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Gula Aren Murni Organik</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif-brand text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-1">
            Manis Legit Alami Tanpa Pemanis Buatan
          </h3>
          <p class="text-stone-300 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-2.5 leading-relaxed">
            Sirup gula aren kami dimasak langsung dari nira pohon aren alami petani lokal. Menghasilkan rasa manis legit gurih yang kaya mineral dan aman dinikmati setiap hari.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-amber-300 font-medium">
          <span>Indeks Glikemik Lebih Sehat</span>
          <span class="text-xl">🌿</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Card 3 (5 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-stone-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            🥐
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 uppercase tracking-wider">Freshly Baked Every Morning</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif-brand text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-1">
            Cerita Roti Selembut Awan
          </h3>
          <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-2.5 leading-relaxed">
            Dibuat menggunakan metode fermentasi khas Jepang dengan mentega pilihan. Roti bantal kami selalu lembut berhari-hari tanpa tambahan bahan pengawet sintetis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center gap-4 text-xs font-semibold text-stone-700">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-emerald-500">✓</span> 100% Halal MUI</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-emerald-500">✓</span> Isian Berlimpah Lumer</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Card 4 (7 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-stone-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-5 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
            🛡️
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 uppercase tracking-wider">Standar Kebersihan & Pengemasan</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif-brand text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-1">
            Seal Rapat Anti Bocor & Suhu Terjaga
          </h3>
          <p class="text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-2.5 leading-relaxed">
            Semua minuman dikemas dengan teknologi cup sealing otomatis kedap tumpah, menjaga sensasi es tetap dingin atau suhu hangat tetap terjaga optimal saat diantar kurir ke rumah atau kantor Anda.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-stone-100 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs font-semibold text-stone-700">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-emerald-500">✓</span> Kemasan Food-Grade Ramah Lingkungan</span>
          <a href="#menu-section" class="text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-800 font-bold inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            Lihat Menu Kami &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
